 "notes": [
  "Starting cards per the strategy: ISB Operations, Coruscant, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, plus one of Imperial Decree (vs. drain decks), Secret Plans (vs. Hidden Base) or You Cannot Hide Forever (default). Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published.",
  "Secret Plans is the pre-Reflections III Effect. Hoth Echo Docking Bay, Yavin 4 Docking Bay and Tatooine Docking Bay 94 are the Dark sites (the strategy uses the Rebel base docking bays as Imperial Decree locations).",
  "Posted '2 Twi lek Advisor' dested Twi'lek Advisor (x2); 'Tarkin' and 'Veers' are the Premiere / Hoth characters of those names.",
  "Posted 'Tarkin' dested Grand Moff Tarkin (the only Tarkin card in the 2001 pool)."
